{"nodes": [{"id": "claude_layered_architecture", "label": "Arquitetura em camadas (presentation \u2192 application \u2192 domain \u2190 infra)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Arquitetura em camadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "As camadas do frontend espelham a separa\u00e7\u00e3o do backend Spring e a depend\u00eancia aponta sempre para dentro, de modo que domain permanece puro (sem Angular) e trocar infra/HTTP n\u00e3o afeta application nem presentation."}, {"id": "claude_domain_layer", "label": "Camada domain/ (models, enums, ports)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Arquitetura em camadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Contratos puros sem imports do Angular: os models espelham os DTOs do backend, garantindo que a mudan\u00e7a de framework n\u00e3o contamine o contrato."}, {"id": "claude_infra_layer", "label": "Camada infra/ (http + mappers)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Arquitetura em camadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_application_layer", "label": "Camada application/ (facades com signals)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Arquitetura em camadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00c9 a \u00fanica camada que a tela injeta; depende de domain/ports e n\u00e3o da implementa\u00e7\u00e3o em infra/, o que permite testar a tela sem HTTP real."}, {"id": "claude_presentation_layer", "label": "Camada presentation/ (features lazy + layout shell)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Arquitetura em camadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_core_layer", "label": "Camada core/ (config, interceptors, guards)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Arquitetura em camadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_shared_layer", "label": "Camada shared/ (componentes, pipes, utilit\u00e1rios)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Arquitetura em camadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_apiurlinterceptor", "label": "apiUrlInterceptor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Conex\u00e3o com o backend", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Centraliza o prefixo da API: reposit\u00f3rios declaram s\u00f3 o caminho do recurso (/corretoras), ent\u00e3o trocar de ambiente muda um token de configura\u00e7\u00e3o, n\u00e3o N reposit\u00f3rios."}, {"id": "claude_api_base_url", "label": "API_BASE_URL (environment.apiBaseUrl)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Conex\u00e3o com o backend", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_proxy_conf", "label": "proxy.conf.json (/api \u2192 localhost:8080)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Conex\u00e3o com o backend", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O backend n\u00e3o tem CORS configurado, ent\u00e3o o dev server precisa fazer o proxy; chamar http://localhost:8080 direto do browser quebraria."}, {"id": "claude_httperrorinterceptor", "label": "httpErrorInterceptor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Conex\u00e3o com o backend", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Converte toda falha em ApiError para que nenhuma camada acima precise conhecer HttpErrorResponse \u2014 o tipo de erro vira contrato de dom\u00ednio."}, {"id": "claude_apierror", "label": "ApiError (domain/models/api-error.model.ts)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Conex\u00e3o com o backend", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_page_model", "label": "Page<T> (domain/models/page.model.ts)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Conex\u00e3o com o backend", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_topageparams", "label": "toPageParams() (core/http/http-params.ts)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Conex\u00e3o com o backend", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_spec_driven_workflow", "label": "Fluxo spec-driven (specs antes da implementa\u00e7\u00e3o)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Fluxo de trabalho deste projeto", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nenhuma tela ou caso de uso \u00e9 criado sem spec correspondente em .spec/features/, para que a especifica\u00e7\u00e3o continue audit\u00e1vel mecanicamente contra o c\u00f3digo."}, {"id": "claude_signals_state_management", "label": "Estado com signals (computed / linkedSignal)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## State Management", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Estado derivado sempre por computed() e transforma\u00e7\u00f5es puras; proibido mutate \u2014 s\u00f3 update/set \u2014 para manter a reatividade previs\u00edvel."}, {"id": "claude_signal_forms", "label": "Signal Forms (@angular/forms/signals)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "### Components", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Est\u00e1veis no Angular v22+, d\u00e3o estado baseado em signals, acesso tipado a campos e valida\u00e7\u00e3o por schema \u2014 preferidos a Reactive Forms em formul\u00e1rios novos."}, {"id": "claude_acessibilidade_axe_wcag", "label": "Requisito de acessibilidade AXE / WCAG AA", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "## Accessibility Requirements", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "claude_page_model", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_paginacao", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Listagens do backend s\u00e3o `Page<T>` do Spring", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_topageparams", "target": "claude_page_model", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "monte os query params de pagina\u00e7\u00e3o com `toPageParams()`", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_topageparams", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_paginacao", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_apierror", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_standarderror", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "j\u00e1 carrega `fieldErrors` do `StandardError` do backend", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_httperrorinterceptor", "target": "claude_apierror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "converte qualquer falha no `ApiError`", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_apiurlinterceptor", "target": "claude_api_base_url", "relation": "references", "confiden